DTSTAMP:20260804T174418Z
DTSTART:20260804T174500Z
DTEND:20260804T194500Z
SUMMARY:K-8 Studies Weekly Curriculum Training (online)
DESCRIPTION:In this virtual training\, educators will learn how to effectively blend the physical Studies Weekly newspaper format with its companion online tools to deliver engaging social studies instruction. Teachers will explore digital features\, interactive resources\, and implementation strategies to seamlessly bring this curriculum to life in their classrooms. https://us02web.zoom.us/j/88505147241?pwd=VZb0ZtRfRGjw7oTAkjQ7YItWSaOeNE.1
END:VEVENT
